{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤマザキ レナ です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ、よくヤマサキとかレイナとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"呼ばれるんだ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもその度に指摘するのも面倒になってきちゃって、もうそう呼ばれたらそれで受け止めてる。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"病院で間違った読み方で呼ばれると、 一瞬自分のことだと気がつかないから、それだけが難かなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正しい方で読んでいただけたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたいですo(^▽^)o(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとザキの字は、文字化けすることが多いから併用されているけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は上が\"大\"じゃなくて\"立\"のほうなんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"機種によっては、文字化けして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プンスカ怒ってる顔文字に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変換されちゃうから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくメンバーにも笑われるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会の券の当選メールも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまに山プンスカになってるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうそれはそれで面白いから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現状維持で良いかなって思ってる。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、私が知っている範囲での芸能界でいうと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女優の宮﨑あおいさんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ\"﨑\"のようです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式ニックネームは れなち です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは、あだ名歴で言ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"約10年くらいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母の友達が、幼い私のことを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなちれなちと可愛がってくれたのが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"由来です(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それ以来、あだ名を付けられることが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生において無かったので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのまま公式ニックネームに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使用しました。単純。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、乃木坂46に入るまで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あだ名が無い人間だったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"付けにくいタイプの名前なのかなと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝手に解釈していたのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなち、れなちさん、れなっさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ザキ、ザキさん、ザキちゃん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と約3年間で急激に増え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"挙げ句の果てに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近では伊藤純奈や北野日奈子に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ザキち と呼ばれるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もはや誰だよ( ^o^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤマザキって長いから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"呼びやすいのかな～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも逆に親近感を持って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"呼んでもらえてるみたいで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか有難いです！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/12/11/4520471/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/12/11/4520471/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなどうでもいい話をしてみた笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにはね(｡･∀･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【告知】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売中のもの↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○月刊エンタメ（のぎマニア）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○日経エンタテイメント！アイドルSpecial2016（全メンバーのインタビュー掲載）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから発売します↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎12/18 乃木坂46物語"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎12/22 UTB（2期生グラビア対決）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎12/25 FLASHスペシャル（似顔絵師の写真とインタビュー）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ告知できていない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シークレットのものが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと２つあるよ(｡･∀･｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type